{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Bound the invocation-end drain wait.** If an export or the newly invoked `flush()` stalls, this unconditional wait prevents `on_invocation_end` from returning until Lambda times out, potentially causing workflow retries and duplicate side effects. Use a configurable finite timeout, log and return when it expires, and retain timed-out terminal records separately from coalescible progress snapshots so the worker can finish them best-effort.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7thOdI","finding_digest":"61f0e039fd14eac79ca039a6df2359e575a0ab353e9bc1843cca637404c11e8b","finding_id":"arf_v1_mhyoaop5ctvmphfahgtn6i2z4v","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.drain::bounded-invocation-wait","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.drain::bounded-invocation-wait","line":102,"observation_digest":"c7d4a599d538971f31b41ef533d53b5f0c5eef75825d741cdf9eb44020c86769","observation_id":"aro_v1_y7kklgovhclr6mnud32thvj3l4","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-11T00:49:19Z","review_id":"arr_v1_p6hmyuchs6cpgpxp6cqsmfitiu","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"dbaccc93964a40d7e2c7905cc6f78ac823573943","reviewer":"codex","start_line":102,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":719},"record_id":"art_v1_vjutljzojf7nm7m6qpqdezhah5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T00:49:19Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
